  "public_url": "jobs/python-developer-trellisconsulting-1786143",
  "title": "Python Developer",
  "organization_id": 2121991,
  "type": "jobs",
  "subtype": "jobs",
  "regn_open": 1,
  "updated_at": "2026-11-01T20:37:59+05:30",
  "region": "online",
  "visibility": "public",
  "details": "<p><strong>Role:</strong></p>\n<p>We are looking for a Python Backend Developer to develop and maintain our <strong>e-commerce backend web portal</strong> using Python, Django and Django Oscar.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Responsibilities:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Develop and maintain backend modules using <strong>Python &amp; Django</strong>.</li>\n<li>Customize and enhance <strong>Django Oscar</strong> e-commerce modules if needed.</li>\n<li>Develop and maintain <strong>REST APIs</strong>.</li>\n<li>Work on e-commerce modules like <strong>Products, Catalogue, Inventory, Cart, Orders, Customers, Offers, Gift Cards and Checkout</strong>.</li>\n<li>Integrate or modify third-party APIs such as <strong>Payment, Courier, ERP and other services</strong>.</li>\n<li>Write and optimize <strong>SQL queries and database operations</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Debug and resolve application/production issues</strong>.</li>\n<li>Work with frontend, QA teams.</li>\n<li><strong>Maintain clean, reusable and well-documented code</strong>.</li>\n<li>Postman / API testing/ Unit testing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Required Skills:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Python</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Django</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Django Oscar</strong> &ndash;Good to know</li>\n<li><strong>REST API / Django REST Framework</strong></li>\n<li><strong>SQL &amp; Relational Databases</strong> &ndash; PostgreSQL/MySQL/SQL Server</li>\n<li><strong>Django ORM</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Git</strong></li>\n<li>Basic <strong>Linux</strong> knowledge</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Good to Have:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>E-commerce domain experience</li>\n<li><strong>Redis / Celery</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Solr / Elasticsearch / Haystack</strong></li>\n<li>Docker / AWS basics</li>\n<li><strong>Basic AI / Generative AI</strong> knowledge and practical usage</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Candidate Profile:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1&ndash;3 years of hands-on Python/Django experience.</li>\n<li>Good programming and problem-solving skills.</li>\n<li>Understanding of APIs, databases and e-commerce workflows.</li>\n<li>Ability to understand and modify existing code.</li>\n<li>Good communication and teamwork skills.</li>\n</ul>",
