 {
  "id": 1778984,
  "public_url": "jobs/software-engineering-specialist-python-fullstack-ge-vernova-1778984",
  "title": "Software Engineering Specialist- Python Fullstack",
  "organization_id": 982590,
  "type": "jobs",
  "subtype": "jobs",
  "regn_open": 0,
  "updated_at": "2026-11-01T15:41:11+05:30",
  "region": "online",
  "visibility": "public",
  "details": "<p data-lfile-container=\"68e07d53-9169-4e5f-8561-195e33870e90\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>GE Vernova is hiring for the role of Software Engineering Specialist- Python Fullstack!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Responsibilities of the Candidate:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Build, maintain, and enhance end to end product features across frontend, backend, and data layers</li>\n<li>Develop robust, reusable, and maintainable UI components using modern frontend technologies, preferably Angular</li>\n<li>Develop backend services and APIs in Python, ensuring scalability, reliability, security, and maintainability</li>\n<li>Design, build, and optimize REST APIs for internal and external product integrations</li>\n<li>Write clean, testable, and well documented code that adheres to engineering standards and best practices</li>\n<li>Create and maintain unit and integration tests to improve reliability and reduce regression risk</li>\n<li>Contribute to CI/CD workflows, build pipelines, and deployment readiness activities</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 to 2 years of professional software engineering experience in full stack product development environments. For roles outside USA: Bachelor's Degree in Computer Science or &ldquo;STEM&rdquo; Majors (Science, Technology, Engineering and Math) with basic experience.</li>\n<li>Strong proficiency in modern frontend and UI development, preferably Angular, including component based architecture, TypeScript, and responsive web development</li>\n<li>Strong proficiency in Python backend development, with hands on experience building and maintaining production grade services or APIs</li>\n<li>Demonstrated experience designing, developing, and consuming REST APIs</li>\n<li>Strong working knowledge of SQL and relational databases, including schema design, query optimization, and data access patterns</li>\n<li>Experience working with Git based version control in collaborative development environments.</li>\n</ul>",
